  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">LOOP GEAR was created by a group of flasholics who used to be kidos with boundless imagination about universe. They strive to blend the universe elements into flashlights which is their another commom interest, design and manufacture stylish, playable flashlights. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">LOOP GEAR SK01s, also named the Skywalker, is our first product, we built it like people built the spacecraft, it looks that way, when you look at it, it is a space ship shape.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The DSL like head, just like the eyes to the \"ship\",</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Tail switch with ambient light effect just like the engine，</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Spinner in the neck is just like propeller,</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Spinable tactical ring on the body is just like a radar</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Slide body with a window is like the gate into it.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Do you feel the same way?</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We design products to outstand from the common ones, nowadays you don't need a lot of common products, you just need one and unique.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>